        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etaa Daudi olaiguanani le Israel o le Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki iltung'ana pooki le Israel aaiturrurro tenebo te netii Daudi te Hebron, nejo ninche, “Ng'ura, kira iyiook oloito lino o sesen lino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too nkolong'i naatulusoitie, o enapa kata doi ninye aa olaiguanani Saul, iyie apa orikoo Israel aipang'ie nintijing'u; nikitiaaka iyie Olaitoriani Enkai ino, ‘Iyie oaku olairritani loo iltung'ana laainei Isiraeli, naa ilo aaku olkitok oitore iltung'ana laainei le Israel.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eetuo ilpayiani pooki le Israel enetii olaiguanani te Hebron; neitobir Daudi olning'o o ninche te Hebron te dukuya Olaitoriani. Nebukoki ninche Daudi eilata aaput metaa olaiguanani le Israel, te risioroto o rorei lo Laitoriani oimunye Samuel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.15.63"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh 15.63",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.1.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilari 1.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore Daudi, o ltung'ana pooki le Israel nepuo Yerusalem, aa taa Yebus, ine apa netii Ilyebusi lelo oomanya ina kop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki lelo oomanya Yebus Daudi, “Milotu iye ine.” Ore ake eyia neibung Daudi ina ang nagol e Sion, aa taa, enkanasa e Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Daudi, “Ore oltung'ani oiter arasaki Ilyebusi naa keaku olkitok neaku olarikoni le njore.” Ore olayioni le Seroya, neituruk alo, neaku etaa ninye olkitok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebik Daudi tiatua ina ang nasheta sunta, neaku etejoki apa ine enkanasa e Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neshet ninye ina anasa aitamanaa ebaiki Milo neidip aitamanaa. Neitoki Yoab aram ineetebelate te nkanasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neponari Daudi aaku kitok oleng, amu etii apa Olaitoriani loo lororani tenebo ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isikarini le Daudi ning'ot",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kulo apa ilkituaak le lelo tung'ana le Daudi magil, laa ninche ootijing'a ninye enkoriong te nkitoria enye, tenebo Israel pooki, pee eitaa ninche olaiguanani, te risioroto o rorei lo Laitoriani oipirta Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulo lelo tung'ana le Daudi magil; Yashabean le Hakomon, ilo arikoni le lelo okuni, etara ninye te mpere iltung'ana iip uni near pooki metuata te nkata nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore oliare ninye te lelo pokira okuni magil naa, Eliesa olayioni le Dodo, le Ahoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etii apa ninye tenebo Daudi te Pas-damim ina kata apa pee eiturrurro Ilfilisti teine to larrabal. Etii apa ine enkurma nabore shairi neisik iltung'ana aailany Ilfilisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eitasho ninye te mpolos eina kurma neisulie, nesesekuan Ilfilisti, neitajeu Olaitoriani ninche te nkisulata kitok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo okuni le lelo tung'ana pokira tomoni uni kituaak nedoyio aapuo endapidapoi ine netii Daudi te nkapune e Adulam, ina kata etii enjore oo Lfilisti ilng'oborri to erata le Refaim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii apa Daudi ina kata atua osempewuet; netii oltim loo Ilfilisti ina kata Betlehem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Daudi eeta enkure, “Woi naaji tenatum oltung'ani laayaki enkare naok to lchorro le Betlehem otii embata e kishomi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo tung'ana okuni magil neim atua ilng'oborri loo Lfilisti; nepuo aaoku enkare teilo shorro le Betlehem otii embata e kishomi, neyaki Daudi. Kake eitu eok Daudi, etubukoko ninye Olaitoriani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejo, “Maatalama nanu ena te dukuya Olaitoriani tenaa kaas ena. Kaok nanu osarge le nkishui le kulo lewa? Amu etipika ninche enkishui enye batisho pee eyau.” Kuna baa etaasa lelo tung'ana okuni magil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa Abishai, olalashe le Yoab laa olarikoni le tomoni uni. Near ninye te mpere iltung'ana iip uni metuata, nening'oyu enkarna enye tenebo lelo okuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninye apa yioloti oleng te lelo tomoni uni, neaku olarikoni lenye, kake eitu etiu anaa lelo pokira okuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore apa Benaia olayioni le Yehoida naa oltung'ani oning'o oleng te Kabseel olaasani loo mbaa sapuki; etara ninye iltung'ana oare yiolot le Moab metuata. Eshomo sii apa ajing'aki olng'atuny te ngumoto near metua teina olong apa naiputa enkirobi enkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etara sii apa metua Olmisiri, ilo tung'ani apa sapuk laa ntemat e nkaina imiet enkadoro, eeta ilo Misiri empere enye naba anaa embokishi; kake eshomo Benaia enetii ninye eeta eng'udi ake, newuapaa empere te nkaina e ilo Misiri near ninye metua te mpere enye makewan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuna baa etaasa Benaia olayioni le Yehoida, nening'oyu enkarna enye tenebo lelo tung'ana okuni magil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ening'o apa ninye oleng te lelo tomoni uni, kake menyaanyukie lelo pokira okuni. Nepik Daudi ninye meitasheiki lelo arripok lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa lelo tung'ana magil loo njorin naa Asahel, olalashe le Yoab, o Elhanan olayioni le Dodo le Betlehem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Shumot le Harod, o Heles le Peloni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
